#HELPS
1 ADDAMASARTUS SLAVER CAMP~
Addamasartus is a small slavers' cave nestled northeast of coastal Seyda Neen,
housing three armed smugglers, their captives and a lone rat in damp passages.
Flooded tunnels offer an underwater route past crates and scattered contraband
before the cave narrows into the outlaws' guarded den.
~
